<Placemark>   <name>Krzyż Pokutny Cisów</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <b>County/Region:</b> Dolnoslaskie <b>Alt Name:</b> Cisów Penance Cross <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 50.8505941 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 16.2574804<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Eastern_Europe/Poland/thumb/cisow-krzyz2.JPG" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    Ancient Cross in Dolnoslaskie. A medieval penance cross (krzyż pokutny) is located east of the ruins of Cisy Castle. The tradition of penance crosses became common in Silesia in 13th century, they we...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
		     <a href="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/article.php?sid=50865" >Link To More Information</a><br />
                    ]]></description>    <styleUrl>#46_r</styleUrl>   <Point>     <coordinates>16.2574804,50.8505941,0</coordinates>   </Point>  </Placemark>
<Placemark>   <name>Krzyże Pokutne Gubin</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <b>County/Region:</b> Lubuskie <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>4</b> Condition: <b>3</b> (5 is best)   Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 51.944535 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 14.726245<br />
                    Ancient Cross in Lubuskie. Three partly destroyed early crosses without crossbars in front of a wall....<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
